  "body": "This spacious, freehold four-bedroom, three-bathroom home offers easy contemporary living across approximately 190sqm. Its flexible floor plan suits growing families, professionals, multi-generational households, or anyone needing a dedicated work-from-home space.\r\n\r\nSet on a sunny north-facing corner site, the home is filled with natural light. It also features two separate entrances, a rare advantage that gives extended family, guests or independent living arrangements their own private access.\r\n\r\nThe home has been freshly repainted throughout and presents in near-new condition. It is ready to move straight into.\r\n\r\nProperty Features\r\n\r\n• Freehold title with no body corporate fees\r\n• Internal-access single garage plus carport\r\n• Two separate entrances, ideal for multi-generational living or rental income\r\n• Double glazing throughout for warmth and quiet\r\n• Designer kitchen with quality appliances and a spacious walk-in pantry\r\n• Excellent storage on every level\r\n• Sunny deck and balcony for outdoor entertaining\r\n• Freshly repainted, low-maintenance, lock-and-leave lifestyle\r\n\r\nSmales Farm, the Northern Busway station and North Shore Hospital are all close by, giving you an easy commute to Auckland CBD. Takapuna town centre, Takapuna Beach, and a wide choice of cafés, restaurants and shopping are only minutes away.\r\n\r\nThe home is zoned for, or close to, some of Auckland’s most sought-after schools, including Takapuna Grammar School, Westlake Boys High School, Westlake Girls High School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate and Takapuna Primary School. Carmel College, Rosmini College and St Joseph’s School are also nearby.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re looking for a family home, a quality investment or a stylish executive residence, 9 Te Uru Lane offers modern, spacious and versatile living close to the beach.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a private viewing, or visit one of our upcoming open homes.",
